    {
      "k": "cmd",
      "prompt": "~",
      "text": "xo login me --key --url http://127.0.0.1:8790 < ~/.demo-key",
      "id": "xo-login",
      "accept": [
        "xo login",
        "xo login --key",
        "xo login me",
        "xo login me --key"
      ]
    },
    {
      "k": "out",
      "dt": 0.137,
      "text": "xo: services from the xo server at https://xo.quirq.dev:\nxo:   me     https://xo.quirq.dev (the xo server; your XO key is only sent here)\nxo:   xo     https://dev.xo.builders (creates and xo spaces --space-id; your key reaches it through the xo server)\nxo:   github https://github.com (gh's own login; xo never sees the token)\nxo: the server's list gives no address for xo; showing xo's own, which may not be where it sends creates\nxo: logging in to https://xo.quirq.dev; the key will only ever be sent there\n"
    },
    {
      "k": "out",
      "dt": 0.021,
      "text": "xo: checking the key with XO through https://xo.quirq.dev ...\n"
    },
    {
      "k": "out",
      "dt": 0.012,
      "text": "xo: me: logged in as sam (user_sam); key and URL saved to ~/.config/xo/credentials (only you can read it); xo logout deletes them\n"
    },
    {
      "k": "end",
      "dt": 0.027,
      "code": 0
